Summer is the second season of the year. It's preceded by [[Spring]] and followed by [[Fall]].

Most of the Stardew Valley Expanded NPCs will attend the vanilla summer festivals - the [[Stardew:Luau|Luau]] on Summer 11, the [[Stardew:Trout Derby|Trout Derby]] on Summer 20 - 21, and the [[Stardew:Dance of the Moonlight Jellies|Dance of the Moonlight Jellies]] on Summer 28.

